{"data":{"body":"**P3 \u2014 Add unit coverage for the context handoff.** The new regression tests are all under `tests/e2e/`, while AGENTS.md and CONTRIBUTING.md require every runtime change to include a related unit test. Add a focused case to `tests/execution_test.py` asserting that invocation-start `ContextVar` bindings reach the handler worker and that handler rebinding is discarded after both return and exception paths.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM74l2O6","finding_digest":"8a7e170b2c826ef6be062116ae093c9b79366a367ce9b3f8fb67ee9be59cfc1c","finding_id":"arf_v1_rj7boczmqjxpnpqgeelk4cj4tn","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python/execution.py::wrapper::missing-unit-test-coverage","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python/execution.py::wrapper::missing-unit-test-coverage","line":321,"observation_digest":"11bf7a4413b9fd5341ba00187dbf6eabaf7f6921709367f4f677effa925111ed","observation_id":"aro_v1_cg7xuratxh6vgqn2aamh3p3ovo","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python/execution.py","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-02T23:31:06Z","review_id":"arr_v1_gj46c7vqqlquoy7bkkq5fsno7b","reviewed_base_sha":"631b78d1b505b157eee758662291fc5e2353bbb6","reviewed_head_sha":"7d89a4e513041e51b7e242129fed22d5a6a0c08f","reviewer":"codex","start_line":319,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":756},"record_id":"art_v1_iqdgkyia7bklivcla76fyx4mzx","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-02T23:31:06Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
